---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { business } from "../config/business";
const updated = "October 3, 2026";
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`Privacy Policy | ${business.name}`}
  description={`How ${business.name} collects, uses and protects the information you share through this website.`}
>
  <section class="bg-white py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6">
      <div class="prose-sf">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 md:text-5xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-base text-slate-500">Last updated: {updated}</p>

        <p>
          This policy explains what information {business.name} ("we", "us") collects through
          {" "}{business.url.replace("https://", "")}, how we use it, and the choices you have.
        </p>

        <h2>Information you give us</h2>
        <p>
          When you fill in a form on this website, we receive what you enter: usually your name, phone number, email
          address, city and a description of the job. We also record which page and form you used and which website or ad
          brought you to us, so we know how people find us.
        </p>

        <h2>Information collected automatically</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Visit statistics without cookies.</strong> We count page views, clicks on our phone number and the
            general source of a visit (for example a Google search or an ad). Visitors are counted anonymously; we do not
            store your IP address or set cookies for this.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Google Analytics.</strong> We use Google Analytics to understand how the website is used. Google
            Analytics uses cookies and processes data according to
            {" "}<a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google's privacy policy</a>.
            You can opt out with the
            {" "}<a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Analytics opt-out browser add-on</a>.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>How we use your information</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>To respond to your request and prepare an estimate.</li>
          <li>To contact you about the job you asked about.</li>
          <li>To understand which pages and advertising bring us customers, so we can improve the website.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do not sell your personal information, and we do not use it for unrelated marketing.</p>

        <h2>Who processes it for us</h2>
        <p>
          Form submissions and visit statistics are stored in a lead management system run by our web developer, hosted
          with Supabase, and emailed to us through Resend. Google processes Google Analytics data. These providers handle
          the data only to provide their services to us.
        </p>

        <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
        <p>
          We keep form submissions as long as needed to handle your request and keep normal business records. Raw visit
          data is deleted after 90 days; only daily totals are kept.
        </p>

        <h2>Your choices</h2>
        <p>
          You can ask us what information we hold about you, or ask us to correct or delete it, through our
           <a href="/contact-us/">contact form</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>Children</h2>
        <p>This website is not intended for children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect their information.</p>

        <h2>Changes</h2>
        <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The date at the top shows when it last changed.</p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about this policy: send them through our <a href="/contact-us/">contact form</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
